  "catalog": {
    "slug": "coffee-roastery",
    "title": "Coffee Roastery",
    "version": "0.1.0",
    "author": "simetro",
    "description": "Green beans in, single-origin bags out. Time the roaster against the wholesale order book \u2014 overshoot a degree and the whole batch is bitter.",
    "tags": [
      "sl1",
      "scenario_language_v1",
      "showcase",
      "daily_life",
      "easy"
    ],
    "palette_note": "Toasted cream and espresso brown; saddle for green beans, copper for the roaster, leaf green for QA pass, sky for shipping, plum for the morning espresso bar.",
    "layout_note": "Green-bean silo (source) feeds the drum roaster (compute_cluster), bags go to the wholesale dock (dashboard), and a quality-control taster overlay (operator) cups every batch.",
    "node_language_note": "source / compute_cluster / dashboard / operator. The compute_cluster is the drum roaster \u2014 heat, time, and capacity all matter.",
    "mover_path_note": "Movers do not exist yet for SL1 scenes; the legacy pieces.movers array is intentionally empty. SL1 links from green-silo to drum-roaster to wholesale-dock encode typed bean flow; the roast-batch and bag-single-origin transforms colocate on drum-roaster, with ship-pallet on wholesale-dock. Cross-place transport will render as moving sprites once the SL1 renderer lands.",
    "review_note": "Marked status=draft in the frontend catalog because the SL1 canvas renderer is not yet wired. Selecting this scene loads it successfully and shows catalog metadata in the scene browser. The SL1 HUD chips, dashboard freshness pill, and milestone strip render via the existing SL1 HUD overlay; the bespoke canvas vignette ships when the SL1 renderer is wired in a later PR."
  },
